Algorithm ComputePresheafCompression(C, F):
  for k = 0 to |Ob(C)|:
    for each P subset of Ob(C) with |P| = k:
      if TestSeparation(C, F, P):
        return (k, P)
  return (|Ob(C)| + 1, None)

Algorithm ComputeSheafCompression(C, J, F):
  for k = 0 to |Ob(C)|:
    for each P subset of Ob(C) with |P| = k:
      if TestSeparation(C, F, P) and TestTopologyCompatible(C, J, P):
        return (k, P)
  return (|Ob(C)| + 1, None)

Complexity: O(2^n * n * |F|^2 * max_hom) where n = |Ob(C)|
